NegroniMetal addition to NativeBridgeMetalFrontend.mm:
- Implement MTLFunction protocol conformance on NBFunction to resolve 'fragmentFunction/vertexFunction is not a MTLFunction' in backboardd/SpringBoard.
- Implement NBLibrary -newFunctionWithName:constantValues:pipelineLibrary:error: for specialized pipeline libraries.
- Synchronize command buffer execution before host buffer release (defer scheduled in backboardd, wait completed on scheduled wait) to prevent SIGSEGV during page unmap.

